msgstr "`Lost Reason` `este în` `Prea scump`"

#: ../../content/applications/productivity/data_cleaning.rst:102
msgid ":guilabel:`Time Field`: :guilabel:`Last Updated on (Lead/Opportunity)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Time Field`: :guilabel:`Last Updated on (Lead/Opportunity)`"

